<title>USA: Fed says overnight system totaled $10.087 billion. [CORRECTED 17:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Fed says overnight system totaled $10.087 billion. [CORRECTED 17:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve's overnight system repurchase agreement totaled $10.087 billion, a New York Fed spokeswoman confirmed.</p>
<p>(Corrects headline and text to overnight repurchase agreement from coupon pass.)</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk 212-859-1660 ))</p>
</text>
